{"html":"<h3>Applicable Proof Methods: <span class=\"hl_comment\">Goals sorted according to the tactic written in the theory file: missing</span></h3><br/>\n<div class=\"preformatted methods\">1. <a class=\"internal-link proof-method\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/main/method/done/1\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">contradiction</span> <span class=\"hl_comment\">/* from formulas */</span></a></div><br/>\na. <a class=\"internal-link autoprove\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoprove/idfs/0/False/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (A. <a class=\"internal-link characterization\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoprove/characterize/0/False/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)<br/>\nb. <a class=\"internal-link bounded-autoprove\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoprove/idfs/5/False/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (B. <a class=\"internal-link bounded-characterization\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoprove/characterize/5/False/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)  with proof-depth bound 5<br/>\no. <a class=\"internal-link oracle-autoprove\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoprove/idfs/0/True/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> until oracle returns nothing<br/>\ns. <a class=\"internal-link autoprove-all\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoproveAll/idfs/0/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (S. <a class=\"internal-link characterization-all\" href=\"/thy/trace/1/autoproveAll/characterize/0/proof/done\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)  for all lemmas <br/>\n<br/>\n<h3>Constraint system</h3><br/>\n<div class=\"preformatted sequent\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">last</span>: none<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">formulas</span>: <span class=\"hl_operator\">⊥</span><br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">subterms</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">equations</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hl_keyword\">subst</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hl_keyword\">conj</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">lemmas</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">allowed cases</span>: refined<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">solved formulas</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">unsolved constraints</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">solved constraints</span>:</div><br/>\n<h3>0 sub-case(s)</h3><br/>\n","title":"Lemma: done"}